<speak>Yes, and please do not arrange it as though it is a training course. Then I will feel obliged to prepare, and it will become a bigger thing than it needs to be. Just a simple conversation would be good. My wife can help me find the tablet charger beforehand; that seems to be the item that disappears most often in our house. Once the device is ready, I can handle the rest. I am trying to avoid making my daughter the permanent technology help desk. She has her own work, and it is not fair if every small inconvenience becomes her problem.</speak>